Package: RcppAMGCL
Type: Package
Title: Sparse Iterative Solvers with Algebraic Multigrid Preconditioning
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Santiago", "Hermo", email = "santiago.hermo@monash.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Denis", "Demidov", role = "cph",
           comment = "Author of the bundled AMGCL library"))
Description: Solve sparse linear systems using conjugate gradients or
    stabilized bi-conjugate gradients with algebraic multigrid
    preconditioning from the header-only 'AMGCL' library. Supports compressed
    sparse column matrices, reusable solver objects, and optional 'OpenMP'
    acceleration with explicit control over the number of threads. Provides
    a reusable C++ interface for downstream packages.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)
Imports: Matrix, methods, Rcpp
LinkingTo: Rcpp
SystemRequirements: C++14, GNU make; OpenMP (optional)
NeedsCompilation: yes
URL: https://github.com/santiagohermo/RcppAMGCL
BugReports: https://github.com/santiagohermo/RcppAMGCL/issues
